  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
    <tr><th>Cause</th><th>Fix</th><th>Card</th><th>Up close</th><th>When</th><th>How common</th><th>Still</th><th>From</th></tr>
    <tr><td>A ring's element is failing</td><td>element</td><td>a ring is weak</td><td>one ring slow, the others fine</td><td>always</td><td>●●●</td><td>"New element. That ring's still weak: it clicks, no heat."</td><td>Day 2</td></tr>
    <tr><td>A ring's switch relay is sticking</td><td>relay</td><td>a ring is weak</td><td>it clicks but sometimes won't heat</td><td>touched</td><td>●●</td><td>"New relay. Still slow to heat."</td><td>Day 2</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Its setting has drifted</td><td>tune</td><td>runs hot</td><td>every ring too fierce; Brennan complains</td><td>always</td><td>●●</td><td>—</td><td>Day 4</td></tr>
