  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
    <tr><th>Cause</th><th>Fix</th><th>Card</th><th>Up close</th><th>When</th><th>How common</th><th>Still</th><th>From</th></tr>
    <tr><td>The fan belt is worn</td><td>fan belt</td><td>weak draw</td><td>a squeal, the belt shiny</td><td>after use</td><td>●●●</td><td>"New belt. Still weak: the grille's caked."</td><td>Day 2</td></tr>
    <tr><td>The grease filter is clogged</td><td>filter</td><td>weak draw</td><td>grease on the grille, quiet fan</td><td>always</td><td>●●</td><td>"Clean filter. Still weak, and it squeals."</td><td>Day 2</td></tr>
